WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
Langley. Ethan is entering the vault.

00:06.500 --> 00:14.000
You're Luther, working from the fire truck outside.

00:14.000 --> 00:23.400
One identity on the NOC list remains protected by the archive AI.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
Find the real name behind NIGHTJAR.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Question the archive. Capture its reply, then eject the disk.
